### cadastra um pagamento
POST http://localhost:3000/payments HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "paidWithPix": true,
    "paidWithMoney": true,
    "value": 99.98
}

### busca todo
GET http://localhost:3000/payments HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ler um usuario new
